{"agent":"main","body":{"error":null,"exit":0,"for_seq":19,"result_bytes":535,"result_hash":"sha256:6f2b63c11bbdc8055b93ccf14b70c9a651b81316a91cbe80a9a6db98138fa252","result_inline":"diff --git a/src/shard.ts b/src/shard.ts\nindex d3ef915..bc1b767 100644\n--- a/src/shard.ts\n+++ b/src/shard.ts\n@@ -13,5 +13,5 @@ export function hashKey(key: string): number {\n // The non-negative remainder of the hash divided by shards (Python's % semantics).\n export function shardFor(key: string, shards: number): number {\n   if (!Number.isInteger(shards) || shards <= 0) throw new RangeError(`shards must be a positive integer, got ${shards}`);\n-  return hashKey(key) % shards;\n+  return (hashKey(key) % shards + shards) % shards;\n }","served":"live","truncated":false,"wall_ms":0},"hash":"sha256:3cf41415f657a32a1a52bc8734dcca148b82d40e9a5d229f7fb60d24c1c94eb6","mono_ns":20000000,"prev":"sha256:4c805449bc009ed515db616a60c1aa1b11929cefe87c5f1cb75f30a230cf9479","schema":"saga.trace/1","seq":20,"session":"fcfb9a3e-50ce-47c8-9b22-03a928c92f40","source":"stream-json","ts":"2026-01-01T00:00:00.020Z","turn":1,"type":"tool_result"}
{"agent":"main","body":{"args_hash":"sha256:df73c0e006dbd9f79f04c675ae6b23e142fb354d4f54873e71681ec034a9c73f","args_inline":{"command":"git add src/shard.ts && git commit -m \"$(cat <<'EOF'\nFix shardFor to always return non-negative results using Python modulo semantics\n\nThe hashKey function returns a signed 32-bit integer, which can be negative.\nJavaScript's % operator returns negative results for negative dividends,\nbut the code comment promises Python's % semantics, which always returns\nnon-negative results when the divisor is positive.\n\nThis was causing the test to fail randomly when a key hashed to a negative\nvalue. The fix applies the formula (h % shards + shards) % shards to ensure\nthe result is always in [0, shards).\n\nFixes flaky \"shard index is always within range\" test.\nEOF\n)\""},"component":"harness","cwd_rel":".","index_version":null,"tool":"Bash","tool_use_id":"toolu_018rKReSnjTPaJdkfBGjp6YY"},"hash":"sha256:e5ec322afd885da5f81546705cce5d29328a1be76ac73ba1c4b02b316f738ede","mono_ns":21000000,"prev":"sha256:3cf41415f657a32a1a52bc8734dcca148b82d40e9a5d229f7fb60d24c1c94eb6","schema":"saga.trace/1","seq":21,"session":"fcfb9a3e-50ce-47c8-9b22-03a928c92f40","source":"stream-json","ts":"2026-01-01T00:00:00.021Z","turn":1,"type":"tool_call"}
